1
00:00:00,919 --> 00:00:03,169
(Sheldon:)Sheldon's here.

2
00:00:10,303 --> 00:00:13,223
(Penny:)Thanks. That's much better.

3
00:00:14,766 --> 00:00:16,846
(Raj:)Oh, I'm so hungry.

4
00:00:17,018 --> 00:00:20,558
(Leonard:)Will you shut up? We're all hungry.

5
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:24,320
(Howard:)Okay, our objective
is the Boy Scout campsite to the east.

6
00:00:24,484 --> 00:00:28,734
Easy target. Big, doughy scoutmaster,
couple of Cubs, mostly Webelos.

7
00:00:28,947 --> 00:00:30,157
What kind of score?

8
00:00:30,323 --> 00:00:33,363
(Howard:)Hot dogs, buns, s'mores.
I mean, it's a freaking 7-Eleven.

9
00:00:33,535 --> 00:00:36,285
(Leonard:)-All right. Everyone grab flashlights.
-Okay.

10
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,580
(Howard:)Oh, my God. Could it be? Yes!

11
00:00:42,752 --> 00:00:45,422
My mother put an "I love you" brisket
in my backpack!

12
00:00:45,588 --> 00:00:47,338
(Leonard:)-Quick, get forks.
-Don't need forks.

13
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:49,637
(Howard:)It's so tender, it falls apart in your hands.

14
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,970
(Raj:)-He's right.
HOWARD: Yes.

15
00:00:53,138 --> 00:01:00,018
[ALL GRUNTING]

